0:49.480" end="00:49.750">like </span><span begin="00:49.750" end="00:50.260">I've </span><span begin="00:50.260" end="00:50.440">been </span><span begin="00:50.440" end="00:51.160">living </span><span begin="00:51.160" end="00:51.790">life </span><span begin="00:51.790" end="00:53.140">asleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.910" end="00:59.140"><span begin="00:54.910" end="00:55.510">Love </span><span begin="00:55.510" end="00:55.810">so </span><span begin="00:55.810" end="00:56.380">strong </span><span begin="00:56.380" end="00:56.500">it </span><span begin="00:56.500" end="00:57.070">makes </span><span begin="00:57.070" end="00:57.220">me </span><span begin="00:57.220" end="00:57.760">feel </span><span begin="00:57.760" end="00:58.030">so </span><span begin="00:58.030" end="00:59.140">weak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.140" end="01:04.330"><span begin="00:59.140" end="00:59.170">Are </span><span begin="00:59.170" end="00:59.230">you </span><span begin="00:59.230" end="00:59.380">lonely</span><span begin="00:59.380" end="00:59.830">? </span><span begin="00:59.830" end="01:00.280">（</span><span begin="01:00.280" end="01:00.700">Are </span><span begin="01:00.700" end="01:01.000">you </span><span begin="01:01.000" end="01:01.750">lonely</span><span begin="01:01.750" end="01:03.040">?</span><span begin="01:03.040" end="01:04.330">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.330" end="01:08.320"><span begin="01:04.330" end="01:04.660">Our </span><span begin="01:04.660" end="01:05.410">fingers </span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:06.490">dancing </span><span begin="01:06.490" end="01:07.030">when </span><span begin="01:07.030" end="01:07.540">they </span><span begin="01:07.540" end="01:08.320">meet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.590" end="01:13.000"><span begin="01:08.590" end="01:08.950">You </span><span begin="01:08.950" end="01:09.340">seem </span><span begin="01:09.340" end="01:09.700">so </span><span begin="01:09.700" end="01:12.550">lonely </span><span begin="01:12.550" end="01:12.550">（</span><span begin="01:12.550" end="01:12.640">Are </span><span begin="01:12.640" end="01:12.700">you </span><span begin="01:12.700" end="01:12.940">lonely</span><span begin="01:12.940" end="01:12.970">?</span><span begin="01:12.970" end="01:13.000">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.000" end="01:17.140"><span begin="01:13.000" end="01:13.360">I'll </span><span begin="01:13.360" end="01:13.720">be </span><span begin="01:13.720" end="01:14.050">the </span><span begin="01:14.050" end="01:15.100">only </span><span begin="01:15.100" end="01:15.670">dream </span><span begin="01:15.670" end="01:16.120">you </span><span begin="01:16.120" end="01:17.140">seek</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.170" end="01:21.970"><span begin="01:17.170" end="01:17.770">So </span><span begin="01:17.770" end="01:18.070">if </span><span begin="01:18.070" end="01:18.370">you're </span><span begin="01:18.370" end="01:19.480">lonely</span><span begin="01:19.480" end="01:19.480">, </span><span begin="01:19.480" end="01:19.840">no </span><span begin="01:19.840" end="01:20.290">need </span><span begin="01:20.290" end="01:20.440">to </span><span begin="01:20.440" end="01:21.130">show </span><span begin="01:21.130" end="01:21.970">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.000" end="01:27.040"><span begin="01:22.000" end="01:22.420">If </span><span begin="01:22.420" end="01:22.660">you're </span><span begin="01:22.660" end="01:23.800">lonely </span><span begin="01:23.800" end="01:24.370">come </span><span begin="01:24.370" end="01:24.820">be </span><span begin="01:24.820" end="01:25.930">lonely </span><span begin="01:25.930" end="01:26.590">with </span><span begin="01:26.590" end="01:27.040">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.040" end="01:30.310"><span begin="01:27.040" end="01:29.860">Lonely </span><span begin="01:29.860" end="01:29.860">（</span><span begin="01:29.860" end="01:30.010">Are </span><span begin="01:30.010" end