g</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.070" end="01:53.680"><span begin="01:48.070" end="01:48.460">If </span><span begin="01:48.460" end="01:48.700">you're </span><span begin="01:48.700" end="01:49.780">lonely</span><span begin="01:49.780" end="01:49.780">, </span><span begin="01:49.780" end="01:50.380">come </span><span begin="01:50.380" end="01:50.830">be </span><span begin="01:50.830" end="01:51.970">lonely </span><span begin="01:51.970" end="01:52.630">with </span><span begin="01:52.630" end="01:53.680">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.060" end="02:05.560"><span begin="02:01.060" end="02:02.560">Underneath </span><span begin="02:02.560" end="02:02.920">the </span><span begin="02:02.920" end="02:03.490">pale </span><span begin="02:03.490" end="02:05.560">moonlight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.860" end="02:13.480"><span begin="02:08.860" end="02:10.030">Dreaming </span><span begin="02:10.030" end="02:10.510">of </span><span begin="02:10.510" end="02:10.780">a </span><span begin="02:10.780" end="02:11.830">circus </span><span begin="02:11.830" end="02:13.480">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.590" end="02:21.250"><span begin="02:17.590" end="02:18.430">Carousels </span><span begin="02:18.430" end="02:18.760">and </span><span begin="02:18.760" end="02:19.780">Ferris </span><span begin="02:19.780" end="02:21.250">heights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.700" end="02:29.350"><span begin="02:24.700" end="02:25.240">I'll </span><span begin="02:25.240" end="02:25.690">be </span><span begin="02:25.690" end="02:26.320">yours </span><span begin="02:26.320" end="02:26.740">if </span><span begin="02:26.740" end="02:27.190">you'll </span><span begin="02:27.190" end="02:27.670">be </span><span begin="02:27.670" end="02:29.350">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.930" end="02:35.770"><span begin="02:31.930" end="02:32.410">Cause </span><span begin="02:32.410" end="02:32.620">I'm </span><span begin="02:32.620" end="02:33.790">lonely</span><span begin="02:33.790" end="02:33.970">, </span><span begin="02:33.970" end="02:34.270">I'm </span><span begin="02:34.270" end="02:34.570">so </span><span begin="02:34.570" end="02:35.770">lonely</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.920" end="02:39.640"><span begin="02:35.920" end="02:36.340">If </span><span begin="02:36.340" end="02:36.580">you </span><span begin="02:36.580" end="02:37.120">hold </span><span begin="02:37.120" end="02:37.660">me</span><span begin="02:37.660" end="02:37.660">, </span><span begin="02:37.660" end="02:37.960">I'll </span><span begin="02:37.960" end="02:38.290">be </span><span begin="02:38.290" end="02:38.680">your </span><span begin="02:38.680" end="02:39.640">only</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.640" end="02:43.540"><span begin="02:39.640" end="02:40.150">Are </span><span begin="02:40.150" end="02:40.480">you </span><span begin="02:40.480" end="02:41.230">lonely</span><span begin="02:41.230" end="02:41.230">? </span><span begin="02:41.230" end="02:41.230">（</span><span begin="02:41.230" end="02:41.260">Are </span><span begin="02:41.260" end="02:41.320">you </span><span begin="02:41.320" end="02:43.210">lonely</span><span begin="02:43.210" end="02:43.370">?</span><span begin="02:43.370" end="02:43.540">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.540" end="02:47.290"><span begin="02:43.540" end="02:43.870">Our </span><span begin="02:43.870" end="02:44.590">fingers </span><span begin="02:44.590" end="02:45.550">dancing </span><span begin="02:45.550" end="02:46.030">when </span><span begin="02:46.030" end="02:46.510">they </span><span begin="02:46.510" end="02:47.290">meet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.440" end="02:51.460"><span begin="02:47.440" end="02:47.800">You </span><span begin="02:47.800" end="02:48.130">seem </span><span begin="02:48.130" end="02:48.460">so </span><span begin="02:48.460" end="02:50.980">lonely </span><span begin="02:50.980" end="02:50.980">（</span><span begin="02:50.980" en